&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Calculation:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Let the old average = x and the new average = y&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;then, y = x + 8&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;mdash;(1)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Also, y = (9x + 100)/10&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;mdash;(2)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;there4; we get&amp;nbsp;x + 8 = (9x + 100)/10&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;rArr;10x + 80 = 9x + 100&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;rArr; x = 20&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(32, 33, 36);&quot;&gt;&amp;there4; y = 20 + 8 = 28&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;His new average is 28&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

