&lt;p&gt;Female = 180 &amp;times; (2/5) = 72&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;BSNL: 70, M:F = 4:3&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rarr; Total parts = 7&lt;/p&gt;

