&lt;p&gt;Female = 70 &amp;times; (3/7) = 30&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Total male and female SIM users in A&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Male = 75 + 108 + 40 = 223&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Female = 45 + 72 + 30 = 147&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So, difference is 223 &amp;ndash; 147 = 76&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The correct answer is Option (2).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

