&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img height=&quot;26px&quot; src=&quot;//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/key-point-image.png&quot; width=&quot;26px&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Key Points&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The word &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;Elevate&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; means &lt;strong&gt;to raise, improve, or increase the level or quality of something.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;(ऊँचा उठाना / बढ़ाना)&lt;/strong&gt;

	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Example:&lt;/strong&gt; The new policy aims to elevate the quality of public education.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;Decongest&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; means &lt;strong&gt;to reduce overcrowding or relieve congestion.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;(भीड़ कम करना / जाम हटाना)&lt;/strong&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Example:&lt;/strong&gt; The flyover was constructed to decongest the city&amp;#39;s busiest intersection.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;After interchanging &lt;strong&gt;B&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;C&lt;/strong&gt;, the sentence becomes:
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;quot;Metropolitan planners are endeavoring to design sustainable transit networks that &lt;strong&gt;decongest&lt;/strong&gt; vehicular traffic and &lt;strong&gt;elevate&lt;/strong&gt; pedestrian safety.&amp;quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;This revised sentence is grammatically correct because:
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;Decongest vehicular traffic&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; is the appropriate expression.&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;Elevate pedestrian safety&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; correctly means improving the safety of pedestrians.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Hence, the words &lt;strong&gt;B&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;C&lt;/strong&gt; should be interchanged.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Therefore, the correct answer is: &lt;strong&gt;Option 2 (B-C)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img height=&quot;26px&quot; src=&quot;//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png&quot; width=&quot;26px&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Additional Information&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Here are the remaining options explained along with their Hindi meanings and example sentences:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 1: A-D&lt;/strong&gt;

	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Endeavoring&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;प्रयास करना&lt;/span&gt;) means making a serious effort to achieve something.

		&lt;ul&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Example:&lt;/strong&gt; Scientists are endeavoring to develop sustainable energy solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ul&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;This interchange results in &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;planners are pedestrian safety to design&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt;, which is grammatically incorrect.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 3: A-B and C-D&lt;/strong&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;This interchange creates incorrect expressions such as &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;planners are elevate&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;decongest safety&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt;, making the sentence meaningless.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 4: A-C&lt;/strong&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;This interchange results in &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;planners are decongest to design&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt;, which is grammatically incorrect.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 5: No interchange required&lt;/strong&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;This is incorrect because the original sentence contains the incorrect collocations &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;elevate vehicular traffic&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;decongest pedestrian safety&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt;. The correct expressions are &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;decongest vehicular traffic&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;elevate pedestrian safety&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The correct answer is: &lt;strong&gt;Option 5&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img height=&quot;26px&quot; src=&quot;//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/key-point-image.png&quot; width=&quot;26px&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Key Points&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The word &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;Instituted&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; means &lt;strong&gt;officially established, introduced, or put into effect.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;(स्थापित किया गया / लागू किया गया)&lt;/strong&gt;

	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Example:&lt;/strong&gt; The government instituted several reforms to improve public healthcare.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;Disparities&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; means &lt;strong&gt;inequalities or significant differences between people or groups.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;(असमानताएँ / विषमताएँ)&lt;/strong&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Example:&lt;/strong&gt; New policies aim to reduce income disparities across regions.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The sentence is already grammatically correct and logically meaningful:
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;Policies are instituted&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; is the correct expression.&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;Rectify historical disparities&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; is a standard collocation.&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;Ensure equal access to vocational opportunities&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; is also grammatically and contextually correct.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Hence, no interchange of words is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Therefore, the correct answer is: &lt;strong&gt;Option 5 (No interchange required)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img height=&quot;26px&quot; src=&quot;//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png&quot; width=&quot;26px&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Additional Information&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Here are the remaining options explained along with their Hindi meanings and example sentences:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 1: A-C&lt;/strong&gt;

	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Access&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;पहुँच / प्रवेश&lt;/span&gt;) means the opportunity or right to use or benefit from something.

		&lt;ul&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Example:&lt;/strong&gt; Every child deserves equal access to quality education.&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ul&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;This interchange results in &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;policies are access&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;ensure equal instituted&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt;, which are grammatically incorrect.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 2: B-D&lt;/strong&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vocational opportunities&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;व्यावसायिक अवसर&lt;/span&gt;) refers to opportunities related to employment, skills, or careers.
		&lt;ul&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Example:&lt;/strong&gt; Skill development programs create vocational opportunities for youth.&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ul&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;This interchange produces &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;rectify historical vocational opportunities&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt;, which is illogical.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 3: A-B and C-D&lt;/strong&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;This interchange creates incorrect expressions such as &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;policies are disparities&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;equal vocational opportunities access&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt;, making the sentence meaningless.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 4: B-C&lt;/strong&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;This interchange forms &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;rectify historical access&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;ensure equal disparities&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt;, both of which are contextually incorrect.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The correct answer is: &lt;strong&gt;Option 3&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img height=&quot;26px&quot; src=&quot;//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/key-point-image.png&quot; width=&quot;26px&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Key Points&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The word &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;Sophistication&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; means &lt;strong&gt;complexity, refinement, or advanced development.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;(परिष्कार / उन्नतता)&lt;/strong&gt;

	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Example:&lt;/strong&gt; The sophistication of the ancient irrigation system amazed historians.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;Uncovered&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; means &lt;strong&gt;discovered, revealed, or brought to light.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;(उजागर किया / खोज निकाला)&lt;/strong&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Example:&lt;/strong&gt; Archaeologists uncovered several ancient coins during the excavation.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;After interchanging &lt;strong&gt;A&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;C&lt;/strong&gt;, the sentence becomes:
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;quot;Excavations at the site &lt;strong&gt;uncovered&lt;/strong&gt; ceremonial artifacts that substantiate previous theories regarding the &lt;strong&gt;sophistication&lt;/strong&gt; of Bronze-Age metallurgy.&amp;quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;This revised sentence is grammatically correct because:
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;Excavations uncovered ceremonial artifacts&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; is the correct expression.&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;The sophistication of Bronze-Age metallurgy&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; is a meaningful noun phrase describing the advanced nature of ancient metalworking.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Hence, the words &lt;strong&gt;A&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;C&lt;/strong&gt; should be interchanged.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Therefore, the correct answer is: &lt;strong&gt;Option 3 (A-C)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img height=&quot;26px&quot; src=&quot;//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png&quot; width=&quot;26px&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Additional Information&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Here are the remaining options explained along with their Hindi meanings and example sentences:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 1: A-B&lt;/strong&gt;

	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Substantiate&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;साबित करना / पुष्ट करना&lt;/span&gt;) means to provide evidence to support or prove a claim.

		&lt;ul&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Example:&lt;/strong&gt; The new evidence substantiates the scientist&amp;#39;s hypothesis.&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ul&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;This interchange produces &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;Excavations substantiation ceremonial artifacts&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; (or &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;substantiates&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; depending on form), which is grammatically incorrect and does not fit the sentence.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 2: B-C&lt;/strong&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;This interchange results in &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;artifacts that uncovered previous theories&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt;, which is illogical because artifacts do not uncover theories; they &lt;strong&gt;substantiate&lt;/strong&gt; them.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 4: C-D&lt;/strong&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bronze-Age metallurgy&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;कांस्य युग की धातुकर्म तकनीक&lt;/span&gt;) refers to the techniques and practices of metalworking during the Bronze Age.
		&lt;ul&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Example:&lt;/strong&gt; Researchers continue to study Bronze-Age metallurgy to understand early technological advancements.&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ul&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;This interchange creates &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;regarding the of uncovered Bronze-Age metallurgy&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt;, which is grammatically incorrect.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 5: No interchange required&lt;/strong&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;This is incorrect because the original sentence contains the incorrect phrase &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;Excavations sophistication ceremonial artifacts&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt;. The correct expression is &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;Excavations uncovered ceremonial artifacts.&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The correct answer is: &lt;strong&gt;Option 1&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img height=&quot;26px&quot; src=&quot;//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/key-point-image.png&quot; width=&quot;26px&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Key Points&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The word &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;Contact&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; means &lt;strong&gt;communication, interaction, or connection between people, groups, or cultures.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;(संपर्क)&lt;/strong&gt;

	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Example:&lt;/strong&gt; Trade routes encouraged contact between distant civilizations.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;Divergence&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; means &lt;strong&gt;the process of becoming different or moving apart.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;(विचलन / अलगाव)&lt;/strong&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Example:&lt;/strong&gt; Linguistic divergence occurs when communities remain isolated for long periods.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;After interchanging &lt;strong&gt;A&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;D&lt;/strong&gt;, the sentence becomes:
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;quot;The historical &lt;strong&gt;divergence&lt;/strong&gt; of regional dialects is frequently driven by geographic isolation and intermittent &lt;strong&gt;cross-cultural contact&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;This revised sentence is grammatically correct because:
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;Historical divergence of regional dialects&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; is a standard linguistic expression.&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;Intermittent cross-cultural contact&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; is a meaningful collocation that contrasts with geographic isolation.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Hence, the words &lt;strong&gt;A&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;D&lt;/strong&gt; should be interchanged.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Therefore, the correct answer is: &lt;strong&gt;Option 1 (A-D)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img height=&quot;26px&quot; src=&quot;//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png&quot; width=&quot;26px&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Additional Information&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Here are the remaining options explained along with their Hindi meanings and example sentences:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 2: B-C&lt;/strong&gt;

	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driven&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;प्रेरित / संचालित&lt;/span&gt;) means caused or influenced by something.

		&lt;ul&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Example:&lt;/strong&gt; Economic growth is often driven by technological innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ul&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Intermittent&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;रुक-रुक कर होने वाला&lt;/span&gt;) means occurring at irregular intervals.&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Interchanging these words results in &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;is frequently intermittent by&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt;, which is grammatically incorrect.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 3: A-B and C-D&lt;/strong&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;This interchange creates &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;historical driven&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;intermittent divergence cross-cultural&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt;, making the sentence grammatically incorrect.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 4: A-C&lt;/strong&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;This interchange results in &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;historical intermittent of regional dialects&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt;, which is meaningless and grammatically incorrect.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Option 5: No interchange required&lt;/strong&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;This is incorrect because the original sentence contains the awkward expression &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;historical contact of regional dialects&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt;. The intended meaning is &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;historical divergence of regional dialects&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt;, influenced by isolation and intermittent cross-cultural contact.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
